    "sentence_translations": [
      "Prepare for the New Year’s Party",
      "",
      "The New Year is coming up. Have you received any party invitation? Remember to get ready for it!",
      "",
      "First, you need to prepare something to bring to the party.",
      "If it’s a party where everyone should bring some food, you can bring a dish or dessert made by yourself.",
      "If it’s a dinner party, take a bottle of wine with you.",
      "If you are going to gather with friends in a restaurant or a bar, then you don’t need to bring any present.",
      "",
      "Second, choose suitable clothes.",
      "Normally there is a dress code on the invitation. If not, you can also ask the host of the party what to wear.",
      "You also need to check the weather forecast.",
      "",
      "Last, have a good rest the night before the party.",
      "Then you will have more energy to talk with people, and take part in various activities during the party.",
      ""
    ]
  }
